# AET-WO-4400h (2): the one local twin change MAVLink injection needs: usart1's receive DMA request routed to
# DMAMUX1 request 41 (usart1_rx_dma; RM0433 Table 121). Applied by sh/replay.sh REQ=1 to the platform the CLI boots
# (platform-booted.repl, an update over the stock stm32h7.repl). In the twin it is one line from platform.rs, as for
# SPI's DMARecieve -> dmamux1@N (crates/aethelgard-twin/src/platform.rs:789-790). Renode's STM32F7_USART raises
# ReceiveDmaRequest (STM32F7_USART.cs:87, :109). Not committed to any crate.
--- platform-booted.repl
+++ platform-booted.repl
@@ -102,6 +102,7 @@
     frequency: 200000000
 usart1:
     frequency: 72000000
+    ReceiveDmaRequest -> dmamux1@41
 usart2:
     frequency: 72000000
 usart3:
